<title>INDIA: Indo Rama 96/97 net 15.5 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Indo Rama 96/97 net 15.5 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    15.5 vs    N/A</p>
<p>    Div (percent)	  7   vs    N/A</p>
<p>    Turnover	  11,960   vs  9,010</p>
<p>NOTE: Indo Rama Synthetics Ltd said in a statement that high interest costs of 730 million rupees and depreciation of 570 million affected net profit. It said exports rose to 2.48 billion rupees in 1996/97 from 2.03 billion in the previous year. With full utilisation of installed capacities and an increase in turnover, the firm expects margins to improve substantially in 1997/98, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
